          "label": "Actual PBPS sharp first-corrector bound and Lemma B.3 consumer",
          "tex": "|C(u,v)|\\le\\frac{\\|u\\|^2+\\|v\\|^2}{2\\gamma},\\quad |C(f_P,f_V)|\\le\\frac{\\|f\\|^2}{2\\gamma},\\quad\\tfrac12\\|f\\|^2\\le L\\le\\tfrac32\\|f\\|^2."
